{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "577067e3-2dd2-45b6-b08a-93cff83d9024",
    "name": "Telekom DPS APIs",
    "description": "DPS HAL APIs — party-management 3.54.0, customer-management 4.67.0, product-inventory 4.64, omni-party-interactions 1.3.0.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Import `telekom-dps-test.postman_environment.json` a vyber ho v dropdown-e.\n2. Vyplň `bearer_token`.\n3. **VPN required** — `teai.st.sk:8243` (DPS) a `tapigw.sk.tmo` (OMNI).\n\n**Auto-headers:** collection-level pre-request script automaticky generuje UUID pre `X-Request-Id`, `X-Request-Tracking-Id`, `X-Request-Session-Id`.\n\n**Collection variables:**\n- `base_url` — `https://teai.st.sk:8243/omni/test1` (Party Management, Customer Management, Product Inventory)\n- `omni_pi_base_url` — `https://tapigw.sk.tmo/omni/test1/party-interactions/1.3.0` (OMNI Party Interactions)\n\nGroups:\n- **Party Management** — identify a party by RČ/OP/pas/IČO, fetch single party\n- **Customer Management** — fetch customer, billing account, related sub-resources\n- **Product Inventory** — MSISDN lookup, product details, per-customer counts\n- **OMNI Party Interactions** — read and write customer interaction records (calls, chats, emails)\n- **End-to-end flows** — composed requests that mirror the live `identifikacia_*` tools",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{bearer_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Auto-generate the three required tracing UUIDs.",
          "// Override these on the request level if you want a specific value.",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Request-Id',           value: pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}') });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Request-Tracking-Id',  value: pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}') });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Request-Session-Id',   value: pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}') });"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Generic assertions that fit every endpoint.",
          "pm.test('content-type is JSON when body present', function () {",
          "    if (pm.response.code === 204 || pm.response.code === 404) return;",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type') || '').to.match(/application\\/json/i);",
          "});",
          "pm.test('not 401/403 (token still valid)', function () {",
          "    pm.expect([401, 403]).to.not.include(pm.response.code);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
